{"id":37596652233,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAIwO9iyQ","head_branch":"fix/hikari-pool-settings-2.41","head_sha":"1d561b42889821f8ffaeb0b6cd27e25095c12fb2","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":53454,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"fix: apply Hikari pool sizing and lifetime settings [2.41]","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":101844678418,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAXtmp3Eg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37596652233","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37596652233","created_at":"2026-10-07T08:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T09:03:03Z","run_started_at":"2026-10-07T08:52:07Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37596652233/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37596652233/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/101844678418","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37596652233/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37596652233/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37596652233/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: apply Hikari pool sizing and lifetime settings [2.41]\n\nThe Hikari pool was built before its sizing was set, so minimumIdle was\nfixed at 10 and connection.pool.min_idle/max_idle_time/max_lifetime_seconds\nwere ignored. Integration tests set min_idle=3, but every cached Spring test\ncontext still kept 10 connections, which exhausts the Postgres test container\n(max_connections=100) once enough distinct contexts exist (seen on 2.42 as\n\"too many clients\" in CacheInvalidationMessagePublisherTest).\n\nConfigure HikariConfig before constructing the data source and add the\nconnection.pool.min_idle, keep_alive_time_seconds and max_lifetime_seconds\nkeys as on 2.43 (#21261, #23015). Defaults match the previous effective\nHikari values; max_idle_time is only applied to Hikari when set explicitly\nbecause its 7200s default is sized for c3p0.","author":{"name":"Morten Svanaes","email":"msvanaes@dhis2.org"},"id":"1d561b42889821f8ffaeb0b6cd27e25095c12fb2","tree_id":"453d30e8de426625fe73f2141dd3c511722373d9","timestamp":"2026-10-07T08:37:00Z","committer":{"name":"Morten Svanaes","email":"msvanaes@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web API.","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core","fork":false,"private":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/{archive_format}{/ref}","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.